  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till den nationella valkommissionen i Rwanda</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the National  Electoral Commission - Election support 2008-2011</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the National Electoral Commission of Rwanda during the period 2008-2011 (an election cycle with parliamentarian elections in 2008, presidential elections 2010 and local and senatorial elections in 2011). Support to institutional and technical capacity development, civic education and transparent, and credible elections. Financed through a Basket Fund with NL, DFID, EC.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">t&#xf6;d till Rwandas nationella valkommission under perioden 2008-2011 (en s k valcykel med parlamentsval 2008, presidentval 2010, lokal- och senatval 2011). St&#xf6;d till institutionell och teknisk  kapacitetsutveckling, medborgarutbildningar, och transparenta val. Finansieras genom en gemensam fond med NL, DFID, EC.</narrative>
  </description>
